msgid ""
"Create a card for every customer in the levels programme who has an email "
"(for B2B: each contact person) and email it. Switching this on emails "
"everyone who has no card yet."
msgstr "Loo kaart igale tasemeprogrammi kliendile, kellel on e-posti aadress (B2B puhul igale kontaktisikule), ja saada see e-kirjaga. Sisselülitamisel saadetakse kaart kõigile, kellel seda veel pole."

